    "title" "Viewpoint Extraction Support"
    "description" "[h1]Viewpoint Extraction Support[/h1] Displays configurable helicopter models during Extraction Mode pickups in Project Viewpoint. [h2]Features[/h2] [list][*]Shows a selected helicopter during the final approach, boarding and departure stages. Each extraction randomly chooses from the selected models that are installed and available.[*]Supports the seven aircraft already supported by Visible Helicopter Events: UH-1B Huey, MH-92 Nightfang, Little Bird, Chinook, Black Hawk, UH-1 Huey and AH-1 SuperCobra.[*]Optionally supports FTZ Hummingbird, Orca and Hellcat. Select only the aircraft mods you want; FTZ Helicopters also requires FTZ Flying. Selected FTZ aircraft are also available to Visible Helicopter Events' random model selection when enabled there.[*]Adds positional extraction audio in Viewpoint while preserving the original Extraction Mode and Visible Helicopter Events behavior.[*]Shows extraction areas in the 3D world, including terrain-following yellow boarding markers.[*]Keeps extraction points visible before an event is active and exposes Board Extraction Helicopter through Viewpoint when boarding is available.[*]Optionally hides the Extraction Mode HUD unless an inventory or loot window is open.[*]Optionally applies NeatUI styling to Extraction Mode menus when NeatUI_Framework is installed; the normal interface remains available through Mod Options.[/list] [h2]Requirements[/h2] [list][*]Project Zomboid Build 42.21+[*]Extraction Mode[*]Project Viewpoint[*]ZombieBuddy 2.3.4+[*]Visible Helicopter Events[/list] Aircraft mods are optional. UH-1B Helicopter additionally requires Aviation Core; FTZ aircraft require FTZ Helicopters and FTZ Flying. Keep Show event aircraft enabled in Visible Helicopter Events. Extraction timing, boarding rules, zombie attraction and server synchronization remain owned by Extraction Mode.

Workshop ID: 3827358939
Mod ID: ViewpointExtractionSupport"
    "changenote" "0.1.15: Add optional selectable VHE aircraft and FTZ helicopter models. Aircraft dependencies are optional."
}
